2225:.\src\pd_hal/pdss_hal.c ****      * Enable the HPDIN_CHANGE interrupt with both edge detection. As HPD module
2226:.\src\pd_hal/pdss_hal.c ****      * can't detect HPD events across deep sleep, this interrupt is used to ensure
2227:.\src\pd_hal/pdss_hal.c ****      * that device doesn't go back to deepsleep after HPD status changes.
